 "description": "<p>A double-layer leather collar with a small bell and attached chain, in set white or set black. The doubling is structural - two leather bands rather than one wide one, which flexes better at the throat.</p>\n<p>The small bell is the quieter choice against the big-bell versions elsewhere in this category. Collar adjusts through 40-50 cm, and the chain arrives matched to the set.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: leather</li>\n<li>Item type: double collar with chain</li>\n<li>Style: retro, small bell</li>\n<li>Color: set white or set black</li>\n<li>Fit: 40-50 cm circumference</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Choose the set colorway. The subtle-bell option for wearers who want the detail without the jingle.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Double-layer leather collar with small bell and chain in white or black sets, 40-50 cm.</p>\n",
